  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --btn: #0f3460;\n  --btn-hover: #1a4a7a;\n  --btn-active: #0a2647;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 16px 0 24px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--accent);\n  min-height: 1.2em;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  min-width: 80px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--btn-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  background: var(--btn-active);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    min-width: 70px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA fully offline pixel-style counter web app built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (-1), and reset to 0\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons\n- Pixel-style design with a centered card\n- Responsive from 360px width\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons to change the count.\n\n- **Increase**: Adds one to the count\n- **Decrease**: Subtracts one from the count\n- **Reset**: Sets the count back to zero\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have `aria-label` attributes\n- Focus states are visible\n- Count uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen readers\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – logic\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No external assets or libraries\n- No inline event handlers\n- Total source under 200 lines",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
